  "query_preview": "..\n(Tuesday through Saturday)\nIssued at 145 PM CDT Sun Aug 2 2026\n\nHigh pressure will continue to control the weather this week.\nHowever unlike last week, the high center will be farther west\nkeeping temperatures very near normal for early August. Dry\nconditions also remain through the end of the week. Not showing up\nin the NBM forecast just yet is a cold front that will be moving\ninto West Texas and eastern New Mexico next weekend. There is\nquite a bit of uncertainty as to whether the front will actually\nmake it into the Permian Basin, but regardless it may at least get\nclose enough to allow for scattered afternoon showers and \nthunderstorms to develop. \n\nHennig",
